WEBVTT

00:07:59.683 --> 00:08:03.145
our fears and what
might be holding us back.

00:08:03.145 --> 00:08:06.941
Though it can be difficult
and uncomfortable

00:08:06.941 --> 00:08:10.778
to take a good, hard look
at our financial behavior,

00:08:10.778 --> 00:08:14.281
it can reveal some deep emotional truths.

00:08:14.281 --> 00:08:18.953
Some truths that can help us
re-evaluate our careers,

00:08:18.994 --> 00:08:22.498
our relationships and our priorities.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:26.502
So give it a try.
The payoff could be huge.

00:08:26.544 --> 00:08:27.795
Thank you.